    {
      "text": "Figure 1(a): Recall@5 on the RECORD-TYPE ablation. Grouped bars for the fourteen teams — Annif, DNB-AI-Project, DUTIR831, Homa, icip, Jim, LA²I²F, last_minute, NBF, RUC Team, silp_nlp, TartuNLP, TSOTSALAB and YNU-HPCC — in alphabetical order on the x-axis. Ten bars per team: A (article), B (book), C (conference), R (report) and T (thesis), each once for the all-subjects dataset and once for tib-core. The y-axis runs 0 to 0.8 and no bar carries a printed value. The tallest group is RUC Team, whose A all-subjects bar reaches about 0.69; Annif, DUTIR831, Jim and LA²I²F sit around 0.6 for A all-subjects; last_minute and TSOTSALAB are near zero throughout, and Homa, DNB-AI-Project, Jim and NBF have bars missing for several record types. READ OFF THE PAGE, not a claim about the work: the sub-caption under this panel says \"based on the language ablation\", but the legend is the record types and Figure 2 is the language ablation.",
